<mxCell id="p1-v19" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v20" parent="p1-v19" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc Capture(CaptureRequest) returns (CaptureResponse);&lt;br&gt;rpc Release(ReleaseRequest) returns (ReleaseResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message CaptureRequest { string hold_id = 1; }&lt;br&gt;// Capture takes the whole hold.&lt;br&gt;// A later partial refund is LLD 5.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message CaptureResponse {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64 entry_id       = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64 balance_amount = 2;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message ReleaseRequest  { string hold_id = 1; }&lt;br&gt;message ReleaseResponse { string status  = 1; }" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v21" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v22" parent="p1-v21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="Capture&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;holds status = captured&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;wallets balance -= amount&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;held    -= amount&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;version + 1&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;wallet_entries&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kind = spend · direction = debit&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source = payment&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source_ref = transaction_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Release&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;holds status = released&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;wallets held -= amount · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;no entry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v24" parent="p1-v23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A hold already captured or released returns the first result.&lt;br&gt;• UNIQUE(brand_id, source, source_ref) blocks a second debit for one transaction.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline is what the Payment worker has left (P-02).&lt;br&gt;• No Ack. Payment publishes payment.events from its own outbox." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v25" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v26" parent="p1-v25" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-09: this is the provider port, the same slot as the Omise call.&lt;br&gt;• Capture is always the whole hold. No partial capture in v1.&lt;br&gt;• Only an entry moves the balance. Release changes held only.&lt;br&gt;• A top-up never comes through here. It is LLD 3 (P-17)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
