<mxCell id="p2-v31" parent="p2-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="topic   payment.events&lt;br&gt;key     brand_id:transaction_id&lt;br&gt;headers event_id, event_type, brand_id,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;occurred_at, version, traceparent&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wallet reads only&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;purpose = top_up, event = captured&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;customer_id · amount · currency&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;transaction_id → source_ref&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every other variant: Ack, no work." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v33" parent="p2-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="wallets  insert if missing&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;UNIQUE(brand_id, customer_id)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;balance_amount += amount · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;wallet_entries&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kind = top_up · direction = credit&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source = payment&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source_ref = transaction_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox (same transaction)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;notification.requested&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;template wallet.topped_up" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v34" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v35" parent="p2-v34" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• No processed_event table. UNIQUE(brand_id, source, source_ref) is the guard.&lt;br&gt;• A second captured for the same transaction_id is an Ack with no work.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff, then wallet.dlq, then Ack.&lt;br&gt;• Ack is the offset commit after the Postgres commit. Auto-commit is off." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v36" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p2-v37" parent="p2-v36" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-10: the Omise charge stays in Payment. This entry is stored value only.&lt;br&gt;• P-17: captured at authorize. A top-up is not refunded to the card in v1.&lt;br&gt;• The send carries customer_id and the template. No phone, no email (D-05).&lt;br&gt;• O-10 limits and O-11 tax-invoice timing are open; nothing is checked here yet." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
