<mxCell id="p3-v27" parent="p3-v26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc Adjust(AdjustRequest) returns (AdjustResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message AdjustRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string idempotency_key = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string customer_id     = 2;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string direction       = 3; // credit | debit&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  amount   = 4;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string reason_code     = 5; // required&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string note            = 6;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;// actor_id comes from x-principal-id.&lt;br&gt;// The limit is on the grant (O-12)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v29" parent="p3-v28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="wallets&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;credit creates the row if missing&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;debit of a missing row is refused&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;balance ± amount · version + 1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;wallet_entries&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;kind = adjust · direction = credit|debit&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source = admin&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;source_ref = idempotency_key&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;reason_code · actor_id&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;audit_log  same transaction&lt;br&gt;outbox     template wallet.adjusted" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v31" parent="p3-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• UNIQUE(brand_id, source, source_ref) on the idempotency_key. A repeat returns the first result (P-01).&lt;br&gt;• admin-bff checks the grant and the limit. Wallet checks the reason and the balance.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline passed down from admin-bff (P-02). No Kafka consume, so no Ack." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v33" parent="p3-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• P-15: one agent can act alone up to the grant&#x27;s limit. The audit row is the control.&lt;br&gt;• A credit is the CSC top-up without Omise. A debit corrects a mistaken top-up (P-17).&lt;br&gt;• No freeze in v1 (P-15). There is no status on the wallet.&lt;br&gt;• The send carries customer_id only (D-05)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
<diagram name="5 · Refund to wallet" id="lld-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1980" dy="960" grid="1" gridSize="8" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1980" pageHeight="960" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
<mxCell id="p4-v1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=22;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;" value="Wallet LLD 5 — Refund: a wallet spend is credited back" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="12" width="1920" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p4-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="An admin refunds a wallet tender in Payment. Payment&#x27;s worker calls Wallet and waits. The card is not involved.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
