<mxCell id="p7-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="The shopper picks wallet at checkout. Order and Payment run the same saga as a card; Payment calls Wallet instead of Omise, so there is no 3DS and no authorize_url. Pages 1 and 2 are the Wallet steps in detail.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
