<mxCell id="p7-v33" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Contract  ·  fields (draft)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="544" width="600" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v34" parent="p7-v33" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="// customer-bff → Order&lt;br&gt;PlaceOrder { idempotency_key, store_id,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;lines, payment_method = &quot;wallet&quot; }&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;// Order → Payment&lt;br&gt;CreateTransaction { idempotency_key = order_id,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;purpose = &quot;order&quot;, method = &quot;wallet&quot;,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;customer_id, amount, currency }&lt;br&gt;→ { transaction_id, status = authorized }&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;// no authorize_url: nothing to open&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;// Payment → Wallet (LLD 1, LLD 2)&lt;br&gt;Hold { idempotency_key = transaction_id, ... }&lt;br&gt;Capture { hold_id }   Release { hold_id }" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v35" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v36" parent="p7-v35" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="Order     orders pending → placed&lt;br&gt;Payment   transactions provider = wallet&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;status authorized → captured&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;or → voided&lt;br&gt;Wallet    holds held → captured | released&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;wallets held, balance&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;wallet_entries kind = spend&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(capture only)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wallet writes no outbox on a spend.&lt;br&gt;Notification hears about the order&lt;br&gt;from order.events, as with a card." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v37" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v38" parent="p7-v37" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Order → Payment keyed on order_id, Payment → Wallet keyed on transaction_id. A retry never holds twice.&lt;br&gt;• The shopper waits until Payment commits authorized. Everything after the POS ticket is async.&lt;br&gt;• Order&#x27;s consume of payment.events and Payment&#x27;s consume of payment.requested each Ack after their own commit.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline from customer-bff runs through Order, Payment, and Wallet (P-02)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v39" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v40" parent="p7-v39" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-09: Payment is still the only door. Order does not call Wallet.&lt;br&gt;• P-16: one tender. No split with a card.&lt;br&gt;• P-14: no hold timer. An unpaid or unanswered order is voided by Order&#x27;s sweeper (P-10), and the void releases the hold.&lt;br&gt;• O-05: if Capture fails after the kitchen accepted, the order follows the same open decision as a card.&lt;br&gt;• Same path for Voucher, MemberCard, and Coupon, with purpose set to that seller." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-v41" parent="p7-v8" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#059669;strokeColor=#059669;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;" value="Ack" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1576" y="324" width="72" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p7-e42" edge="1" parent="1" source="p7-v31" target="p7-v41" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=blockThin;endFill=1;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#059669;fontColor=#059669;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
